WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:10.706
Just want to lift and keep track? Start a workout and log each set as you go. It only takes a few taps.

2
00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:12.016
Here's how.

3
00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:15.332
On Home, tap Start a workout.

4
00:00:15.686 --> 00:00:19.046
Search for your exercise, and tap its Add button.

5
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.420
Then tap the Done button.

6
00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.735
Type in the weight you lifted,

7
00:00:24.189 --> 00:00:25.709
and how many reps.

8
00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:28.710
Then tap the Add set button to log it.

9
00:00:29.092 --> 00:00:32.852
Your first set is in! Tap the Nice button to keep going.
